[thin] Specified cold-core section: Derek selected smooth 2.38 mm standing casing walls and conduit stock for the whole casing, with three Classic loops from each boundary. This is the cold-core exception to the enclosure's ordinary 3 mm section; printed strength and lifetime are not established by the slice.
alternatives: A 3 mm section changes the selected six-bead packing and takes additional foam space; the current section is Derek's explicit geometry choice.
